        "turnOrMisdirection": "When the storm kills the monitor, the mic, and the VoIP phone, Ruth's first instinct is to fix the tech. The real turn happens when she deliberately sets the dead mic down, steps in front of the black screen, and drops her voice instead of raising it.",
        "payoffOrTag": "Transition to your audience by noting that technology is only a bridge\u2014when it collapses, the speaker's stillness and human presence become the real signal.",
